Feature: HTTP App Access Adapter
  As a student using the study-tutor app on my phone
  I want the tutoring session verbs available over the household network
  So that the app works against the same durable sessions as every other device

  Background:
    Given a study-tutor Postgres store with the schema applied
    And the students "lilymay" and "alex" are seeded as identity rows
    And the HTTP session service is running with the dev token table

