  @task:TASK-APP1-04
  @edge-case
  Scenario: A tutor-loop failure mid-turn leaves the session consistent and resumable
    Given lilymay has an active session
    And the tutor loop will fail on the next message
    When the app sends a message to that session
    Then the request should fail with a clear server error
    And the session should remain active and resumable
    And a retried message should succeed once the tutor loop recovers

